 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? Of course. That's thoughtful. Would you stick to the same dishes, just without wheat, or mix it up with something new? Ask your roommate for their favorite gluten free recipes, then choose ones you like. A simple roast or a vegetable curry works well. Soy sauce is fine, most types are gluten free. It' the one with wheat in it that's the problem. And some beers, some baking powder, and most beer. Not forever, and you can still have a bowl of noodles once in a while if she's feeling adventurous.",
